  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "75c7bf50",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "ü§î Three things look wrong:\n",
    "- Someone asked for **2,50,00,000 lakh** (that's ‚Çπ2.5 lakh crore, more than almost any company in India is worth!), while the typical ask is ‚Çπ70 lakh.\n",
    "- A **Gross Margin of 550%**? You can't keep more than 100% of what you sell.\n",
