  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "81d2582b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Phase 4 ¬∑ Feature Engineering: think like a Shark\n",
    "ü§î A founder asks **‚Çπ50 lakh for 5%**, and their company makes **‚Çπ1 crore a year**. What are they *really* claiming?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 14,
   "id": "bd756d59",
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-11-24T12:54:13.116286Z",
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-11-24T12:54:13.115951Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-11-24T12:54:13.122334Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-11-24T12:54:13.120510Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "output_type": "stream",
     "name": "stdout",
     "text": [
      "‚Çπ50 lakh for 5%  ‚Üí  company worth ‚Çπ10 Cr\n",
      "Revenue ‚Çπ1 Cr  ‚Üí  they want 10√ó their yearly revenue\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "ask, equity, revenue = 50, 5, 100\n",
    "valuation = ask / equity * 100\n",
    "print(f\"‚Çπ{ask} lakh for {equity}%  ‚Üí  company worth ‚Çπ{valuation / 100:.0f} Cr\")\n",
    "print(f\"Revenue ‚Çπ{revenue / 100:.0f} Cr  ‚Üí  they want {valuation / revenue:.0f}√ó their yearly revenue\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "dfd11d49",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "That number, **valuation √∑ revenue** (the *multiple*), is exactly what Sharks calculate in their heads: *\"You want 10 times your sales? Justify it!\"* Does the data agree?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 15,
   "id": "4d1a9eb0",
