   "source": [
    "X = pd.DataFrame(index=clean.index)\n",
    "# the ask: log shrinks huge numbers (Lesson 2)\n",
    "X[\"log_ask\"]        = np.log1p(clean[\"Original Ask Amount\"])\n",
    "X[\"equity_pct\"]     = clean[\"Original Offered Equity\"]\n",
    "# traction and greed\n",
    "X[\"log_revenue\"]    = np.log1p(clean[\"Yearly Revenue\"])                    # blank if not shared\n",
    "X[\"log_multiple\"]   = np.log(clean[\"Valuation Requested\"] / clean[\"Yearly Revenue\"].where(has_rev))   # blank if no revenue (can't divide by 0)\n",
    "# money health\n",
    "X[\"gross_margin\"]   = clean[\"Gross Margin\"]\n",
    "X[\"ebitda\"]         = clean[\"EBITDA\"]\n",
    "X[\"ebitda_shared\"]  = clean[\"EBITDA\"].notna().astype(int)                  # a blank can be a clue (Lesson 1)\n",
    "X[\"cash_burn\"]      = clean[\"Cash Burn\"].map({\"yes\": 1, \"no\": 0})\n",
    "# moat and founders\n",
    "X[\"has_patents\"]     = clean[\"Has Patents\"].map({\"yes\": 1, \"no\": 0})\n",
    "X[\"patent_deeptech\"] = (X[\"has_patents\"].fillna(0) * clean[\"Industry\"].isin(DEEP_TECH)).astype(int)   # interaction\n",
    "X[\"bootstrapped\"]    = clean[\"Bootstrapped\"].map({\"yes\": 1, \"funded\": 0})\n",
    "X[\"company_age\"]     = (2021 + clean[\"Season Number\"]) - clean[\"Started in\"]   # Season 1 aired in 2021-22\n",
    "# industry: text for now\n",
    "X[\"industry\"] = clean[\"Industry\"]\n",
    "y = clean[\"deal\"]\n",
    "print(f\"Features: {X.shape[1]} columns (from {df.shape[1] - 1} raw columns) | Rows: {X.shape[0]}\")\n",
    "X.head()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "25fb772f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Our 13 features**, each with a reason:\n",
    "\n",
    "| Feature | Why a Shark cares |\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "| `log_ask`, `equity_pct` | the deal on the table |\n",
    "| `log_revenue` | traction: are customers paying? |\n",
    "| `log_multiple` ‚ú® | greed: valuation √∑ revenue |\n",
    "| `gross_margin`, `ebitda` | is the business healthy? |\n",
    "| `ebitda_shared` ‚ú® | hiding numbers is a red flag |\n",
    "| `cash_burn` | burning money every month? |\n",
    "| `has_patents`, `patent_deeptech` ‚ú® | is the idea protected, and does it matter here? |\n",
    "| `bootstrapped` | built with their own money? |\n",
    "| `company_age` ‚ú® | how long they've survived |\n",
    "| `industry` | Sharks have favourite sectors |\n",
    "\n",
    "‚ú® = a new column we **engineered** (made ourselves).\n",
    "\n",
    "**Not used, and why:**\n",
    "\n",
    "| Columns | Reason |\n",
    "|---|---|\n",
    "| Received/Accepted Offer, Total Deal Amount/Equity, Deal Valuation, Number of Sharks in Deal | ‚õî leakage (only known after the pitch) |\n",
    "| Valuation Requested | already inside `log_ask`, `equity_pct`, and `log_multiple` (it's just ask √∑ equity √ó 100) |\n",
    "| Monthly Sales, Net Margin | repeat Yearly Revenue and EBITDA (Lesson 4) |\n",
    "| Pitchers City, State | small groups, luck (Lesson 3) |\n",
    "| Startup Name, Business Description, Pitch/Episode Number | names and IDs, not business facts |\n",
    "| Presenters, gender, age group, SKUs, Season | no link to deals in our EDA |"
   ]
  },
