  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Stage 1 ¬∑ Three ways to reach a verdict\n",
    "\n",
    "Start with the left panel. Save the two tree panels for the reveal. All three illustrations are simplified examples."
   ],
   "id": "a068c1f0"
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "execution_count": 25,
   "outputs": [
    {
     "output_type": "display_data",
     "data": {
